Package: mbi-pipeline
Type: Package
Title: Metabolic Brain Index (MBI) Pipeline
Version: 0.4.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Dennis", "van der Meer", role = c("aut","cre"))
)
Description: Pipeline to compute normative deviations from structural MRI and
    combine them with a region-wise biological brain map into the Metabolic
    Brain Index (MBI), a spatial contrast between a map-weighted and an
    unweighted mean deviation, alongside the unweighted global index (GBI).
